  "details": "This issue seems to occur both on desktop and VR, but it's more noticeable in VR. Joining either of these worlds and looking at the fishes (particle system) will show the issue.\n\nThis issue doesn't exist on live.\n\nWorlds it happens in so far for me: \n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_490b3750-0762-48cb-91bd-bce4430cac6b \n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_7f9b9fe5-1ef9-4525-836b-e86e095b27e8\n\nEDIT: This issue also appears on avatars with particle systems.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/hfcredddd/status/1696913583928455652\n\n(Credits to hfcRed on their tweet)",
